WEBVTT

00:00:03.310 --> 00:00:04.910
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.050
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.170
Huh? What's the deal with that egg?

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.490
It doesn't look like an X Egg.

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:14.400
Oh, it's Manami-chan!

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.990
She transformed!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:19.120
And who is this girl?

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:21.800
I have a feeling we'll be seeing lots of new things!

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.600
Indeed!

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:24.970
Doki!

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:37.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.080
Howa Howa

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.280
Kira Kira

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:46.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:51.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:59.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:02.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:06.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.800
I can do anything!

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:16.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:25.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:29.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:32.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:37.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:41.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:43.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.520
Howa Howa

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:46.730
Kira Kira

00:01:46.730 --> 00:01:47.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:53.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.730
What nice weather.

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:03.870
Yeah!

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.350
It sure is.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.970
Okay, everyone! Let's give it our best today!

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:10.660
Yeah!

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:15.700
Wh-What?

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:17.720
Hey!

00:02:18.930 --> 00:02:21.080
What do you want with the Humpty Lock?

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:26.290
I heard from Tadase that your Character Transformation powered-up.

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.180
So...

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:31.940
Oh Great Humpty Lock, please power up Dear Baby, too!

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.760
Great Humpty Lock-dechu!

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:40.180
Please make my Dear Baby even cuter!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:35.930
Morning!

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:38.440
Good morning, Tadase-kun, Rima.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:40.180
Yaya, what are you doing?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.890
A power-up spell!

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.220
Oh Great Humpty Lock!

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:52.270
Huh? A new friend!?

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:52.270
Episode 54

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.850
Wow, what pretty flowers!

00:02:54.850 --> 00:02:56.720
What kind of flowers are they?

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.830
They're Gerberas.

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:00.470
In the language of flowers, they represent mystery and ultimate beauty.

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:01.600
Ooh.

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.420
Aren't they just lovely.

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:04.830
Tadase-kun.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:05.970
Thanks, as always.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.930
Don't worry about it. My family runs a flower shop.

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:11.850
Besides, my mother is always bugging me to bring some here.

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.230
Hey, don't you think these flowers suit Hinamori-san?

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:16.830
Yeah, they just might!

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:20.040
They've got a "cool & spicy & lovely" feeling to them!

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:22.710
Lovely? I like the sound of that.

00:03:22.710 --> 00:03:27.660
No way, man. I mean, flowers just aren't my style.

00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:29.770
Doesn't sound like you actually believe that.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:34.030
And, it's after school!

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:38.200
I do wonder when they all find time to study.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:46.080
Hey, did you hear? There's a rumor we're getting a transfer student from a nearby town.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.520
I heard, I heard!

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:51.360
Her mother is the renowned actress Mayuzumi Kahoru.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.430
Although, she's mainly been doing talk shows lately.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:56.100
And her father is French!

00:03:56.100 --> 00:04:00.270
Not only that, he's of noble blood and the owner and head chef of that restaurant, "Maxim's de France"! {reference for spelling: http://www.maxim-s.co.jp/}

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.910
Did you know this?

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:02.830
Nope.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.820
Her mother is an actress.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.550
And her father's a French noble?

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.640
She's got to be a total celebrity!

00:04:12.640 --> 00:04:14.420
And have awesome style!

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:15.840
And be fluent in French!

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.310
But of course!

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:20.270
I wish I could be just like her!

00:04:21.430 --> 00:04:23.200
So that's Hinamori Amu.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.430
I'm home!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:27.950
Welcome home!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:31.870
Oh, you're back, Manami!

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:33.030
Please stop, Dad!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.710
Don't be shy now!

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.710
I said stop!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.160
{miteteba, mou cho-}

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.770
Now, dear, don't surprise Wakana-chan and her friends, okay?

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.130
Oh yeah, we got some new Cosmos flowers in.

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.390
Would everyone like to see them?

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:43.490
Sure!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.310
What'll you do, Rima?

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:49.890
I have to go. If I don't go right home, my mom and dad worry.

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:52.350
Oh, right.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.140
Go check out the flowers.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:56.390
I'll be fine.

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.650
Rima.

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:13.020
Sorry, it looks like you ended up helping us out.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.050
No worries, it was nothing.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:19.270
But you really do love flowers, don't you, Manami?

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.170
Yeah, I adore them!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:24.270
I really think I want to be a florist when I grow up.

00:05:24.270 --> 00:05:28.440
Then again, there are lots of other things I'd like to be, too.

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:32.770
Like maybe a pastry chef, or a kindergarten teacher.

00:05:33.210 --> 00:05:38.430
It's tough to choose just one, when there are so many things you'd like to be.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.140
So true.

00:05:45.420 --> 00:05:46.400
See you!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:47.290
Bye-bye!

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.640
See you tomorrow!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:05:59.060
What's the matter, Miki?

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:00.080
Let's go.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.030
Welcome!

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.390
Amu-chan!

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:15.830
What is it?

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:20.610
Miki said she felt the presence of a Guardian Egg near Manami's house.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:23.640
But Miki was the only one who felt it.

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:25.800
Maybe you were just mistaken?

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:29.910
Anyway, what do you think I should do to repay Manami for the flowers?

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:30.810
To repay?

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:35.270
Well, how about making her some cute cookies?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:36.890
Yeah, that's a great idea!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:38.600
Su, will you help me?

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.470
Of course!

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.170
Cosmos Flower Shop

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:44.180
Here you go.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:47.060
Oh, what a splendid bouquet!

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:51.380
They're so lively. Is there a secret to it?

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:57.310
Oh, no. I just try to listen carefully to what the flowers tell me as I care for them.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:07:00.860
Wow, it's like you can really understand their feelings.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:02.630
Well, of course I can.

00:07:02.630 --> 00:07:04.350
I am a florist, after all!

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.500
Thank you, please come again!

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:29.630
Are you tired?

00:07:29.630 --> 00:07:32.880
Nope, because we satisfied all those customers.

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:34.070
That's right.

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.310
Good afternoon!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:38.180
Amu-chan, what is it?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:41.100
Um, here.

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:43.940
Is that in return for the flowers?

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.580
Oh, you didn't have to do that.

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.970
Wow, they look delicious!

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.000
They really do.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:51.800
Let's see...

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:55.260
They're good!

00:07:55.940 --> 00:07:59.600
Yay! Yay! Yes!

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:02.100
Oh? I'm glad you like them.

00:08:03.300 --> 00:08:05.120
Is it still bothering you?

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.880
There it is again!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:08.590
It's really there!

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:12.350
Oh, you're right!

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:14.840
Amu-chan, we're sensing a Guardian Egg again.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:17.160
We're all certain of it this time.

00:08:17.160 --> 00:08:18.060
Really?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.770
Sorry, Manami-chan. I'll see you tomorrow.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.560
Huh?

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:27.930
Which way?

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.430
That way!

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:31.600
You're contradicting each other!

00:08:39.970 --> 00:08:41.970
Those are your Guardian Characters?

00:08:41.970 --> 00:08:45.100
I guess you won't be much trouble, after all.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:50.870
Could you be the one whose mother is an actress and whose father is a French chef?

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:55.680
Don't be silly. That's exactly why I hate the way Japanese people adore rumors.

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:01.780
I have a name, you know.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:04.430
It is Lulu De Morcerf.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:07.380
Lulu De Morcerf?

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:11.680
So if you can see Guardian Characters, then you must be a Character Bearer, too.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.420
Indeed, I am.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:18.060
However, I have no reason to introduce her to you.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:21.260
After all, we hardly even know each other.

00:09:21.930 --> 00:09:23.550
Pardon me.

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:29.410
Oh, and please don't chase after me.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.530
Though I realize you want to be my friend.

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:38.060
What's with that haughty attitude?

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.170
Yeah, yeah!

00:09:39.170 --> 00:09:41.530
She was very pretty, though.

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.940
That was the only good thing about her.

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:01.600
What is it, Ikuto?

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:02.930
Nothing.

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.030
I went to see Hinamori Amu.

00:10:06.800 --> 00:10:08.180
What do you think?

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.810
She won't be much of a problem.

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:13.180
And her Guardian Characters seem like idiots.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:16.890
Really now? Aren't you the self-confident one.

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:22.840
Boss, I propose using Lulu here as part of the plan acquire the Embryo.

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.640
This child?

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:26.720
Please leave it to me.

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:29.470
And this jewelry.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.680
Yum, these cookies are great!

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:50.930
What is it, Tadase-kun?

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:53.880
Well, I'm just a bit worried about this.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:57.820
Clearly, there has been a drop in the number of X Egg hunts lately.

00:10:57.820 --> 00:10:59.510
Now that you mention it, that's true.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.430
Nor has Easter been making any moves.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:04.370
Easter.

00:11:04.370 --> 00:11:07.510
Maybe they've given up on the Embryo?

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:10.330
You know, since their recent "saucer" plan failed.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:14.830
But I don't think they'll continue to stay quiet like this.

00:11:14.830 --> 00:11:17.620
I have a feeling this is the calm before the storm. {nonliteral}

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:18.940
Don't worry.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:24.830
Even if Easter tries something again, as long as we all work together, there's nothing to fear!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:25.720
Right?

00:11:29.310 --> 00:11:30.850
I'm home!

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.440
Wow, they're so pretty!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.870
Maybe I really should be a florist.

00:11:39.870 --> 00:11:42.970
But there are other things I want to do.

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:47.580
You want to become a florist?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:49.270
You're that girl I met yesterday.

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:52.390
I must grant that wish of yours.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:56.140
You should just become a florist.

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.800
This is magic jewelry.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.390
If you put it on, your dream will come true.

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.560
Jewelry that holds mysterious power?

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:15.190
Yes. The special jewelry that girl creates extracts the heart's egg from any child who puts it on.

00:12:15.190 --> 00:12:22.800
The extracted heart's egg then takes over its owner's heart, and causes them to become delusional.

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:29.070
We then believe it will become a giant X Egg, which will lure out the Embryo.

00:12:29.740 --> 00:12:32.970
Is that so? Well then, carry on.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.220
Yes, Sir.

00:12:38.010 --> 00:12:41.390
My dream? A florist?

00:12:41.910 --> 00:12:45.060
If you hesitate, your dream will never be fulfilled.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:49.640
Just do what y'all wanna do! {note to editor: this is said with an Nagoyan accent... "ii"->"ee"... maybe there's some way to express this?}

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:52.600
? Character Change.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:56.140
What was that feeling just now?

00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:58.800
That wasn't an X Egg or a Guardian Egg.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.630
It felt strange.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.150
Now, on to the next topic.

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:06.620
Although we presented a plan to reduce the amount of homework...

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.350
I agree with getting rid of homework!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.090
Why are you suddenly so excited?

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.510
Amu-chan!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:14.250
We've got big trouble!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.660
We sense a strange egg!

00:13:16.660 --> 00:13:19.290
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.060
Let's go, everyone!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:29.550
Please have some flowers!

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:31.450
Take these flowers to heart!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:35.470
My dream will make everyone happy!

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.760
Please have some flowers!

00:13:41.480 --> 00:13:44.760
Yes, let your dream grow and grow.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.760
Take these flowers to heart!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:47.220
You'll draw out the Embryo.

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:50.390
And if she does that, then <i>your</i> dream will come true, Lulu!

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:57.640
You sure say a lot of things to people, but your dream's all you really care about.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:59.390
Silence, Nana.

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:01.930
Please have some flowers!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.650
I have to tell Ikuto-nya!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:15.510
Yoru! If you're here, then Easter must be up to something.

00:14:18.320 --> 00:14:23.580
Yeah! You'll never get me to talk about the new plan to lure out the Embryo!

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:25.050
Except you just did.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:27.300
A plan to lure out the Embryo?

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:28.660
What do you mean?

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:29.710
Yoru.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.580
Ikuto!

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:34.580
Man, you and your big mouth.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.260
I'm sorry-nya.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.180
Tsukiyomi Ikuto, what are you up to?

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.670
Like I'd know.

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:43.190
Why don't you find out for yourself?

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.840
Let's go, Amu-chan!

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:45.590
Yeah.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.180
Tadase-kun.

00:14:49.510 --> 00:14:51.270
Let's go, too!

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:53.110
You get detention.

00:14:54.610 --> 00:14:56.470
Ikuto!

00:14:59.260 --> 00:15:02.560
What is this? The park's changed into a flower bed!

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:08.440
Amu-chan, there!

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:11.240
Please have some flowers!

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.000
Wow, it's just like magic.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:19.270
What happened?

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.350
Who cares?! If we don't stop her quickly...

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:23.430
Oh, Amu-chan!

00:15:26.010 --> 00:15:27.680
What's with that egg?

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:30.400
That's the egg we sensed earlier!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:34.720
No matter how you look at it, you can tell that egg is manipulating her heart.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:37.970
Manami-chan, please stop making flowers grow!

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:40.300
Why?

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:43.560
Everyone is happier when they look at flowers.

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.670
Are you saying my dream is pointless,

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:49.050
Amu-chan?

00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:51.920
It got bigger!

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.030
I-It smiled!

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:01.840
It swallowed her.

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:11.890
But the biggest surprise comes next.

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:20.220
Character Transformation: Flower Dream!

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.410
A Character Transformation?

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.970
No way! Even though she's not a Character Bearer?

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:28.130
Flowers for everyone! Smiles for everyone!

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:31.930
I'm glad your dream was fulfilled.

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:34.610
You are now the greatest florist in the world.

