00:16:56.760 --> 00:16:58.470
Stop this, Manami-chan!

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:02.720
I won't let anyone interfere, because this is <i>my</i> dream.

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:04.360
Easter.

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:08.650
